id: pm-ado-r5ps
title: The daily release generated its changelog with a drifted copy of the generator flags and its own check refused it
description: "The 2026-10-31 release run 41190222982 failed at Run release checks: changelog:check (with --include-empty since #71) rejected the CHANGELOG.md that the workflow step had just generated without --include-empty. The workflow carried its own copy of the generator flags. Fix: the workflow calls npm run changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes, so the flags exist only in package.json; release:notes also renders empty releases. Fleet-wide coupling is tracked in the companion item pm-cli-website-pnjc."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: changelog,ci,release
created_at: "2026-10-31T14:35:58.231Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-01T11:37:26.472Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-01T11:37:26.464Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-31T15:45:55.000Z"
claim_principal: claude-orchestrator
author: claude-orchestrator
acceptance_criteria: "Release workflow invokes no pm-changelog directly; tests fail when the workflow copy returns or a generator script loses --include-empty; a simulated 2026.10.31 bump passes changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes."
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/pull/74 (merge e214b65af067, head 74a7ed801c58)"
expected_result: "Release workflow invokes no pm-changelog directly; tests fail when the workflow copy returns or a generator script loses --include-empty; a simulated 2026.10.31 bump passes changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes."
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-10-31T15:45:55Z; no readable required checks, so every completed head check run had to succeed, be neutral or be skipped; successful checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, Sourcery review, codeql, cubic · AI code reviewer, release gate (bun), release gate (npm), test (22), test (26)"
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-31T14:36:09.606Z",claude-orchestrator,"Revert proofs: restoring origin/main release.yml fails 'the release workflow generates the changelog only through the package scripts'; restoring origin/main package.json (release:notes without --include-empty) fails 'every changelog generator agrees on empty releases'. End-to-end: npm version 2026.10.31, then changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes all exit 0 and render '## 2026.10.31 - 2026-10-31 / No changes.'"
  "2026-10-31T14:41:12.644Z","harness:claude-code","Gates: release-workflow tests 11/11, typecheck, docstring (97 declarations), verify:release-changelog-date ok. Full release:check: one local failure in packed-install-shapes (npm install of the packed pm-cli tgz, empty stderr) caused by this host's ~/.npmrc; the same suite passes 7/7 with NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null, as CI runs it."
